2ltYmFsbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Kevin Kimball (page does not exist)\">Kevin Kimball</span> (May 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Ambitions\" title=\"Twilight Ambitions\">Twilight Ambitions</a></i> (AGLA1-7). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" title=\"RPGA\">RPGA</a>), p. 31.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SD-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SD_6-0\">6.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SD_6-1\">6.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SD_6-2\">6.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SD_6-3\">6.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a> (October 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Stardeep_(novel)\" title=\"Stardeep (novel)\">Stardeep</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), chap. 11, pp. 130–139. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4338-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4338-8\">978-0-7869-4338-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-AGLA1-7-16_17-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-AGLA1-7-16_17_7-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS2V2aW5fS2ltYmFsbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Kevin Kimball (page does not exist)\">Kevin Kimball</span> (May 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Ambitions\" title=\"Twilight Ambitions\">Twilight Ambitions</a></i> (AGLA1-7). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" title=\"RPGA\">RPGA</a>), pp. 16–17.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-AGLA1-7-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-AGLA1-7_8-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS2V2aW5fS2ltYmFsbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Kevin Kimball (page does not exist)\">Kevin Kimball</span> (May 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Ambitions\" title=\"Twilight Ambitions\">Twilight Ambitions</a></i> (AGLA1-7). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" title=\"RPGA\">RPGA</a>).</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260514040556\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.139 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.206 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3077/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10236/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5521/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9500/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  149.046      1 -total\n 40.96%   61.044      1 Template:Location\n 32.48%   48.409      1 Template:Refs\n  8.15%   12.148      5 Template:Cite_book\n  7.88%   11.748      3 Template:Cite_book/Unapproachable_East\n  7.80%   11.622      2 Template:SI\n  7.70%   11.479      8 Template:Cite_publication\n  4.71%    7.025      3 Template:Cite_organized_play/LFR/Twilight_Ambitions\n  2.34%    3.492      3 Template:Cite_organized_play\n  2.27%    3.379      2 Template:Sigfig\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:132599-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260514040556 and revision id 974820. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&format=json&prop=text&page=Relkath%27s%20Foot","fetchedAt":"2026-05-17T07:01:50Z"}}